---------------------------------------------
## JWT MIDDLEWARE
---------------------------------------------

### Route protégée - sans token
GET http://localhost:3002/api/auth/me

### Route protégée - token invalide
GET http://localhost:3002/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer mauvais_token

### Route protégée - token valide utilisateur
GET http://localhost:3002/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjIsInJvbGUiOiJ1c2VyIiwiaWF0IjoxNzgwMDUyMzAwLCJleHAiOjE3ODAxMzg3MDB9.Nr9pIxvfSY4qFUCTtx4KA8n2TM4bF5ivZNi7NOVJ_7A

